# Large local model files (EDSR is shelved; never commit a 146 MB blob)
# Contents, NOT the directory: git will not re-include a file whose parent
# DIRECTORY is excluded, so plain `nocturne/assets/models` made the negations
# below silently dead and a clean checkout shipped without the model.
nocturne/assets/models/*
# ...but OUR OWN denoise model is a required asset and must travel with the code.
# The directory is ignored because a 153 MB EDSR blob lives there; this one is
# 7.7 MB. An untracked required asset is the update.svg bug again: every local
# test passes because the file is sitting here, and a fresh clone is broken.
!nocturne/assets/models/denoise_*.onnx
!nocturne/assets/models/denoise_*.json

# Internal audits (local-only, like docs/audit and docs/superpowers)
/docs/*_AUDIT_*.md

# PyTorch training environment — NEVER ship or commit; the app uses onnxruntime only
.venv-train/
